<h2>A realistic, FPS-friendly PBR resource pack for Minecraft Bedrock Edition &mdash; built with an automated pipeline that keeps every block up to date.</h2>
<hr>
<h2 style="text-align:center">✅ Vibrant Visuals Compatible &middot; RTX Ready &middot; Deferred Shaders Supported</h2>
<h3 style="text-align:center">\[\\\[Recommended to use with the BetterRTX mod\\\]\](<a href="https://discord.gg/minecraft-rtx-691547840463241267" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">https://discord.gg/minecraft-rtx-691547840463241267</a>)</h3>
<hr>
<h2>Trailers</h2>
<h3>Java Edition:</h3>
<div><span><span><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/0QiNSQ7EFxg" width="638" height="358" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></span></span></div>
<h3>Bedrock Edition:</h3>
<div><span><span><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YPIT-5k1ffY?t" width="638" height="358" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></span></span></div>
<hr>
<h2>What's New</h2>
<p>Optimum Realism's Bedrock pipeline has been completely rebuilt. Every block is now processed through a custom-built automation tool that converts the full Java pack to Bedrock RTX format with consistent PBR quality across the board.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Full 1.21.5 support</strong> &mdash; copper, pale garden, resin, eyeblossoms, and every new block</li>
<li><strong>Vibrant Visuals compatible</strong> &mdash; works with Minecraft's new PBR graphics on Xbox, PlayStation, mobile, and PC</li>
<li><strong>RTX and deferred shader support</strong> &mdash; full PBR pipeline with BetterRTX, YSS SE, and other deferred shaders</li>
<li><strong>Automated quality</strong> &mdash; every block gets the same PBR treatment, no manual conversion gaps</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Is it free?</h2>
<h3>Yes, partially. The 64x version of Optimum Realism is free. Higher resolutions (128x, 256x ) are member-exclusive.</h3>
