<h2>System Requirements</h2>
<p><img src="https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_efbec85a-8737-43f8-a117-222d9f2feb29.png" alt=""></p>
<h3>RTX (BetterRTX mod):</h3>
<p>Just an RTX graphics card is required to run this texture pack smoothly.</p>
<h3>Deferred shaders on PC:</h3>
<p>A GTX 1050 is recommended but not required. Performance depends on your world type and shader settings.</p>
<h3>Deferred shaders on mobile:</h3>
<p>A mid-range device is recommended. <a href="https://discord.gg/yss" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">YSS SE Shaders</a> is the recommended deferred shader for mobile. Performance may vary by device.</p>
<h3>Vibrant Visuals:</h3>
<p>Works on any device that supports Minecraft's Vibrant Visuals mode &mdash; Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, PlayStation 4/5, Android, iOS, and PC. No additional mods needed.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Features</h2>
<p><img src="https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_be2fdf66-7a3c-47a9-8432-4e9f18e71a55.png" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li>690+ PBR materials processed through an automated pipeline</li>
<li>Updated for Minecraft 1.21.5 with full block coverage</li>
<li>Vibrant Visuals, RTX, and deferred shader compatible</li>
<li>Runs on PC, console, and mobile with PBR</li>
<li>3M+ downloads across all platforms</li>
<li>An exemplary balance between quality and performance</li>
</ul>
<h3>Physically Based Rendering with the following maps:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Colour</li>
<li>Normal</li>
<li>Height (Displacement)</li>
<li>Emissive</li>
<li>Metallic</li>
